Throughout, `Λ` is Mathlib's `ArithmeticFunction.vonMangoldt`, the literal
weights are

```
coshVonMangoldt α n = Λ n * cosh (2 α log n),
twistedMoment N α r = ∑_{n ∈ [1,N]} coshVonMangoldt α n * (log n)^r,
```

so `S_r = twistedMoment N α r`, and `cosh` is exactly the functional-equation
pair `n^{2α} + n^{-2α}` of the two tilts (`cosh_split`).

